# Tests

- Prefer extending an existing `tests/test_*.py` over a new file.
- Match neighbors: `from __future__ import annotations`, small FakeCfg dataclasses, mock I/O.
- Assert user-visible Hebrew/HTML fragments when testing formatters (`איך לבצע`, command text).
- No live network in unit tests; freeze time when scheduling matters.
- After adding tests, run: `python -m pytest <files> -q --tb=short`
- New product behavior → also consider `@trading-pulse-test-writer`.
